<h2>Additional Info</h2>
<p>My nickname Karhukarhu is Finnish and translates to Bearbear in English. I have no recall why and when I chose my nickname. There's really no story behind it.</p>

<p>I like to draw and take photos. Horses are a big inspiration for me, but I draw all kinds of stuff except for comics and purely sexual potrayals. I also like to play guitar, but I do it very rarely these days. I'm more of a music listener than player really. Besides guitar, I play videogames too. Survival and simulation games being my favourite</p>

